    "directions": [
      "In a pan heat oil and add mustard seeds, green chillies, onion, tomato and saute for 2 minutes on medium heat.",
      "Now add pav bhaji masala degi red chilli powder and continue cooking for 4-5 minutes or until tomatoes are soft.",
      "Add ladi pav, butter and saute everything properly for 2 minutes.",
      "Then add grated potatoes, paneer, coriander leaves and mix everything properly and cook for a minute.",
      "Remove and let it cool down then grind it into a fine thick paste.",
      "Heat oil in a kadai and in meanwhile make bite size balls from the mixture and deep fry them in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy.",
      "Remove on an absorbent paper and then serve them with, cheesy mayonnaise and guava lemonade drink.",
      "In a bowl add grated cheese, mayonnaise, spring onion and mix everything properly and keep aside for further use.",
      "In a jar add mint leaves, ginger, green chillies, lemon juice, ice cubes, chopped guava and muddle them properly.",
      "Now add black salt, guava juice, black pepper powder and then top it with some club soda. Serve in a serving glass chilled."
    ],
